{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_3_10010_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:89d1924816bb84e9e4ae224d590fd9d018b828e7dfc09bf90692e92fc91e983c",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ddc9dbfa2c20773a2fce0303ea186ea50310072402d53c93657ccb4ccdb6897",
      "text": "疾驰的男儿们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a399aad206efa1a00e498c6ba2e344f78b6731f3eacb60c256c6140e72e7032f",
      "text": "确定起用神速一魂出演朱雀爱读的摩托车杂志CM，\n并在活动舞台上登台。两人干劲十足地迎战活动。\n以二人一宠展现的热血舞台为契机，\n随后又接到了全新工作的洽询……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000014:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bd711a0c587f0c078d13f61396e0634340adf4afbcabad0ac20aea8f2b2a191",
      "text": "序章",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000014:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ddc9dbfa2c20773a2fce0303ea186ea50310072402d53c93657ccb4ccdb6897",
      "text": "疾驰的男儿们",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71912fc0ff82f53245097aa103e67278a259c5429fbe6a8f4e2162b6d3493713",
      "text": "幸好买到这个月的啦！\n重型机车特辑，我可是超级期待的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64d7d7e142ca3ccb7cd6ae2b4e3e87c90e798d8f95d31a9730da75bd06383fab",
      "text": "封面的摩托也太酷了，真想快点看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:70ece7d248e94e4e97263f8beb5c3a0afe9b0f06bb5a60d6d075ba72a6171f12",
      "text": "我也想骑啊，但还没驾照……\n还得说服老爹他们才行呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31f2160db22c618bfbf2989392b94d4f46e2a9a6c55185543f522e09c20842ed",
      "text": "真想什么时候跟玄武一起骑车兜风啊。\n到时候，一定要骑超拉风的摩托……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b17ee4f78a2a4fdb5bf5c8b05cd961ab309c9358bcd64e0d8b8a9738ca861979",
      "text": "喵～！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:61ec56400a9e748e6ed43948ba60dbdbd9ea684474599958c0cb9366d4b8d03f",
      "text": "嘿嘿，当然你也一起啦！\n不对，哇啊！都这个时间了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:298bc1957f7ce720428effbde4a5d72927ffb113d84005e608cbc4074d6f1f31",
      "text": "得去事务所了，不然碰头会要迟到了！\n喵子，要是哪天能接到摩托车的工作就好了啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000077:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:67df782466d2eab07334d1f2058cd01fdf8390f89ed57754d6b276d0ac68bff8",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长，辛苦了。\n那么，今天要谈什么？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b83f176e2ad309309448bcf9bb5f09961984d717bb7d3ff1d6e58674ebce795e",
      "text": "是的，有给神速一魂的邀约。\n这次是摩托车杂志的工作！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_a:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3afbf1a44a8573f453b7b8b4d017c58ef6eea3b390c20f35ab223e20ba10dff4",
      "text": "什、什么——！！？？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1424f3ff4aab258999e6215ad083d463ad29cd26e706a8eee15c6855a6f8102",
      "text": "找我们的摩托车工作——！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37f5119495ccdffd547357f1aefe06e1f02fca26e308d1705548b414d4c38931",
      "text": "是的，没错！这次的工作是起用拍摄摩托车杂志的\nCM，并提供新歌……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ee9610ca5418e19b827b74b728ade06b255b0e97aefba05b55d2866622629d6a",
      "text": "还有就是，希望你们能登上\n活动舞台！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:13dbac7f4e42f8ad2ac62fe71c6975891cae2bf22e54becadaa16e30c55814f4",
      "text": "真、真的假的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0245d195400d991c3e2eeab646d689c7513cb25a9fcee04db374e3031f9272d3",
      "text": "甚至连新歌都能用上啊。\n这不是一份最热血、最棒的工作嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:001e63174913041c14ca09dd30751d9dede4aca5bea48898e385bc56e43f53f4",
      "text": "●●●●●●●●●●番长。\n那本最重要的摩托车杂志是哪本？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47dfb08355a38fcb3993166c289cf19650dc7dd07385d179718d0542c446b525",
      "text": "这就是最新一期。\n请看！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e03e79a07f7ac2746f7766171aac32379e731727521ea7c6904576899e147598",
      "text": "嗯？这是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aad257c59f84e7d73c9f1a10186d4ec3b82bf91b09129fb1ffc79a40bd139ed3",
      "text": "什……么啊。那本杂志，\n不就是我刚才买来的那本吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d33ba2aa4043de0f0f24f6c6a9ee4ca013b2d283196432cb7e95eb2b50b5aea8",
      "text": "你们看！我可是每个月雷打不动都在买的！\n糟、太糟糕了……这也太开心了吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e9326684aae4f5d52aaa2600b0897eeb630548196c32dc91b0f2ed5cb3e8f33",
      "text": "（朱雀先生看起来好高兴。\n我也得加把劲了……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:374c6c11e8d7d3748fce92c788127852723ade5a969575b6750112c96c7f3757",
      "text": "咕～，太棒了……！\n这下可得彻底拿出干劲来了啊！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a390cd57673cb3bd938f1715b43facbd949a1054ceb038a14170c457334c14fd",
      "text": "我也看过，无论哪篇报道都能感受到编辑\n热忱的好杂志啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8797b8d0cefe05d9e3e6edb5fa312c72006d757ad4d130d337e0f8c79eb8fa7c",
      "text": "看中我们才找来的工作……更何况是搭档的\n爱读之书，那就更得全力以赴了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "噢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a66570e1877ca7ed4c87b6152fcf2b461d93ff06ccb9548b734d34e154178dfa",
      "text": "刚才我还跟喵子说，\n要是哪天能接到摩托车的工作就好了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5c355878b804e7ca2d9b7ca37c04ea3c640f8ea3dd6a37f707482709547d859c",
      "text": "没想到居然这么快就实现了……\n嘿嘿，简直跟做梦一样啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:62b1e5e13d852f33dc522b65ad73c40195ca428a17b8e5029e806fa24251ac23",
      "text": "喂，●●●●プロデューサー，\n活动舞台上要做些什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:043de8995e427df96dfece9050e0dc4cb23547143580663250be97a0022534b5",
      "text": "除了关于杂志和摩托车的脱口秀之外，\n还预定公开表演CM中使用的全新曲目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:efb873ab64a9284c659ca3d0618b5c667fa85e4fcc3650aca0110a0916675b88",
      "text": "太好啦，包在我们身上！绝对给你们带来最棒的\n舞台。大干一场吧，玄武、喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3aed9f963b4cb3319e7ccc905b452b12a3dd6f0bf4fa5377b9795f53a726f560",
      "text": "噢！气焰万丈，这里怎能不\n燃烧起来。大干一场吧，搭档！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_c:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360ba9083c5956cea80a92783b8bc7c49b4b06080d9ee4b822bed4c2b6131917",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8d6903fc720dce3f035864ae78cabbd584b180f4a1c4d1a8f1df51c5e1d3110b",
      "text": "活动当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f823049658abcfe6aeed68265aed2cc29781de8803d7103895839f7ff38b5a0e",
      "text": "今天多谢大家到场！\n你们也喜欢摩托吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:02aa236be594f6d7d5be319e826b5cb3cc56e63a7437940e91841e31d6d8abb0",
      "text": "其实我也非常憧憬摩托车。\n每个月都很期待这本杂志呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:00fb1b72ac59cf57f610eb835d34c142b0caa4ccd465f9cb7dbd9ac65ac8c8d6",
      "text": "我可是期期不落全买了哦！\n这个月的封面也超级帅气对吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0b35c14367359941fcdfdedf113c3939e24b391ae7849df8b5a373b97b7b8225",
      "text": "买了最新一期杂志去到事务所，\n正好就来了这个工作……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1d3e255f99e2c2192c34eee5bef69e6c919566b30642ce7280dc48cf6ba1066",
      "text": "哈哈，又说起同一件事了。\n虽然我也很期待，但搭档的高兴劲儿尤为特别啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fa80978f2566689c49efcf42ac876287ca2ef341281a254767d7776bf05461d",
      "text": "嘿嘿……因为，真的超开心的啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000080:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86c160dc0e7e97898620a2fe13101b89dc8d79a96c7359ebf300f9fb8d5cc451",
      "text": "总之，今天的我\n干劲超群啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000087:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31707804db6874d321708f76cc1d013c548bcf9e950cb9a385b4068a19b77c4c",
      "text": "倾注我们宛如烈火燃烧般的心意吧。\n你们也让我们听听最炽热的呐喊声啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca65bf2c00c28fbba3621b881601766c804caa2f9826a0eb6c398a59b183a436",
      "text": "上啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:003fd1d947fbd7245bd4eb8d88358ca195f6d147699f9239243b9ac1cddeec99",
      "text": "喔啦喔啦，怎么啦！\n你们的力量就只有这种程度吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:638a84b9cf6be8031d89fe0ceff01fb9493419dfe615e4f39d803bf9e0f17825",
      "text": "还可以继续往上挂挡的吧！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a78a47d267232f294e51a165c8e056cabbcc56d480b10d1c0a35201b71f31160",
      "text": "（好惊人的魄力。\n干劲的级别完全不一样啊）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48c3e807f96552da5b89b60bb4bd7844adf02183a6f3a3f205a1259d61e205b5",
      "text": "（作为搭档可不能输给他）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:277812c7f051a764ff083b5ebf8c2b63b7ece1c7d163d0e6be4952eb6052e5ca",
      "text": "朱雀！用我们的表演，在观众的\n胸膛正中央，以神速疾驰穿透过去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:25aa7332ffd34563bc9d846ca29287f074908899dec83f08573cedfa3b5a7a6b",
      "text": "噢！上啦，玄武！\n呜喔喔喔喔喔！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0814ebc35f624506dc7dc49d63337d99395022adb3ae9fca9124fb35cac7fc4f",
      "text": "厉、厉害……\n偶像居然能这么帅气的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:885c2d5cc8541321f110dad7f73fde6f88432771d47b3cf6ce06119b424d5db4",
      "text": "咕～～，太特么酷了！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:146ba0b542f598347a24711c30e8b2f1d9ca787469dcc248e801dc8f5895693f",
      "text": "听好了，你们这帮家伙！\n就这样一口气冲到底啦——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8bf559020e7434208b111ce9833413b938710b15ae5776b91edb662a9d1a4035",
      "text": "呜喔喔喔！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:facb6d32ce7025eb1cf12c6a15743a3b490cd32bce8f54617a52d7363864d8d2",
      "text": "神速一魂……\n哼，真是一群燃到爆的家伙啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000074:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f0e7dee7459f09cce99ab9493a965de1c45f77d1ae28531c2a551de6cf7ef221",
      "text": "当晚……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000086:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3eefb0f4236b7ba0e6b94c9264350b9b77ebf66c3790be50216246e2d323a1d",
      "text": "活动辛苦了。\n办得非常成功啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000088:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:aff5ff86dbcb3a3aa949f7162e4b1050b1d8229a2d42b3bde9ebe225740fdcef",
      "text": "观众的声音轰隆隆地\n撞在胸口上啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000090:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:681142886ef4aa35cfc2509521886ea994b627737db4ff3ab13d53eaae0eb230",
      "text": "超级开心的啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000092:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e5f2e11933f2f5f2ea3629340598c1fb024b97f346c1b46b29e9e5bc405d2d53",
      "text": "是啊。愉快适悦，\n是一场不错的演出。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000094:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:50861300a16535d377c43c3fbd55a9088f0845fd8c2869bdd053dd14e18920ae",
      "text": "好期待CM播出的那天啊",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000096:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8445b5bdd6a8d9d7f34ad3a23069b56e39c81c0e79a7972c5b0d5a95c3bc677c",
      "text": "趁着这股势头，\n真想挑战各种各样\n不同的事物啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000098:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cec6780accb4e8d9b005fd31782bdc55e6239c7d9e5f6f2cda7ebf09249f8f1",
      "text": "还有后续的消息哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000098:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27898f32ebf6c8fbbf309dbd3fd25c61e9913a67d56e0c6e7360cf7a9e809133",
      "text": "其实关于这次的工作，\n还有后续的消息！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000101:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ecb0cd14d38e1271b903f77e491372fb9ff86ab9df7393d94020452e0dfffeaa",
      "text": "真的吗！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000103:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0801c621bb4d8fd593abac4c2e1ee01fcb370094d219358e21db931bdb21386e",
      "text": "下次碰头会时\n再告诉你们哦",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000103:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1eed89d57540288f33b6fef35c22f310834b0fcf9c8b21a09e2b84720fb9e736",
      "text": "详情等下次碰头会时\n再告诉你们哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000104:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f90cf99f1ecb8ea0201112c314457cafb62d4decebe397c20ee1dc24637d754b",
      "text": "敬请期待吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000104:choice_detail:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c7c277ffeccd9c4a54dff8d8ca320becebd92cea8963506e8376e630b8f587cc",
      "text": "请好好期待详细情况吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_e:cmd-000108:mobile_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a1243c66f6985513437c0679bd433f15e1a1a0d232a15e53bc514d1320cc289",
      "text": "那可真叫人在意啊。\n下次碰头会，\n我会好好期待着的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:99d20d91dbf78d20033e5d42655676449255ec78e2e53e5e61003602f290b024",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー。\n追加的工作是什么啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1809baa4fc3db35d402cb6ece6497dc81667c369c1b2d35db0f3ab4d496873b",
      "text": "居然……收到了目前正在制作中的\n摩托车电影的出演邀请！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73fce51623337f34fb4fdd1370cfa34e97d5d38407ab55a1f21cb27722ffff30",
      "text": "…………哈？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0e2b10992ffdc1a96f3b04eb80b42dee84437b78b3a1960a24ba6bc01e6f711",
      "text": "什——么！！？？\n真的假的！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f15b3b132e24489a78c0039849dd049848e125144d5e0f1eaadf88611df8160e",
      "text": "这可真是厉害啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c765e851889541515d02a3b6ea5b242550f436fcef39ea46a53239fc0845cf82",
      "text": "前几天的活动，杂志总编和\n摩托车制造商的人也到场了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7b4fcf0ee4f264105da6e69d2291a4195fddf37384b16196fb06a3290c530019",
      "text": "说是非常看中神速一魂，一定要给你们邀约。\n这是资料。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:454527d6fff88b54a93edc67ee6f908875545b2225f9623e3760772fab2fece5",
      "text": "嚯……这不是个好角色嘛。\n真是不胜感激。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:732a387a6ef5c38175f31817b74a32fb797c6ea433567629ad8b0174e19f96b9",
      "text": "真的假的……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b4d8d7bb844deda2e32ac95dbf2f04e2ac71cecd89ba0a08c08130334a0a65c0",
      "text": "我想对两位来说也一定会是一次宝贵的经验。\n这项工作，接下吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000082:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eea1a0439a31e1dec91eaa27a7d8cc9617f0e831ec2029480d47d4e85e82ef08",
      "text": "那还用问吗？\n当然是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_f:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c46b0573d4b68c8715f26e81d0dc70c15079bcc9be62a6b8af02f35bd3c91e4c",
      "text": "大干一场啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:205b537162a622d6c13223069f400d4e8d55bf55b3cd45c60b78e4ab8e51e99c",
      "text": "拍摄当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2393675da0379906720f696347760f6de7f91620425737f9a3097ff799713a71",
      "text": "“嘿，这街道挺不错的嘛。\n就这么开着兜一圈吧”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:86769cb031f41589003e185f700c1b6b24fd1829f0f5ae46ac1acf6c21bc60b7",
      "text": "“站住！！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:550d18ec1bd807c85d52334d5184a451a6c5569929395fcec8a9cca061c52407",
      "text": "“谁！？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:050c860eb7720c7ab6a881cecdc60e982b2f43baffe392a9fcaf57ad895555e0",
      "text": "“你小子是外地来的吧？生面孔啊。\n老子是凤凰朱雀！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0678eee14c0ded00bc6cf04b38e03c4aa11193fe0028589a1c0d5eaae023001a",
      "text": "“老子是凤凰玄武。提起凤凰兄弟，\n在这附近一带好歹也是名声在外的”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d05926bbb54f5d19cbf026eb5c7faeaa6ecf18ac08f3733a43aba38e38079886",
      "text": "“想在这儿开，就先在比赛里赢过我们再说”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ace7d4d5e683f852090cc6a4b311e5ef99fc6bf3da9d62b145b49f27bcaa048",
      "text": "“喵喵，喵——！！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7513f118c7ba24d3abf7bc106a030e97b59fa17365d7a64361da2f118cc34556",
      "text": "“有意思。\n行啊，陪你们玩玩！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_g:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96b2e86eb4d486d1e16339ba5c78bf372a9b74cef05d1ef622d33a41613dac88",
      "text": "“不这样可不行啊。上啦！！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a7505f03d36868570d32c3e6ac2900db4a0526e44863ad93eba5eef253d24f3e",
      "text": "“喔啦喔啦喔啦喔啦！！\n跟上来就已经是极限了吧？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:96175cda5ea7a2c2ad7d4272a23c9ba7b98b903ac5cb8e7e5bd4073a84db38b2",
      "text": "“少在那边游刃有余了。\n从现在起一口气超过去给你们看！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8166de3b3931c07da966ad0a1d87d0c9739ba9728aa6662ac385639464961fa4",
      "text": "“什、加速了……怎么会！？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:924d955743888c65f30877126d113f8e7f191f6bdb7fee33a8abc14b809c3e39",
      "text": "“挺有两下子的嘛。但是……上吧兄弟，\n让他见识见识你极限的爆速！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f2e507c91a64d9841891016ce2ce59ead57ca4ebd5a1dc06ba30e0e2e88c4f5",
      "text": "“噢！！燃起来吧爆炎号！！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a36e2ca267c9a8eb75b09966b3d8df53223cea34d22fe456051235aafe3978",
      "text": "“兄弟，你也让他见识见识！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:000b9f4fd229ae2a1e2cc4f56e84366f58d4ef775e17456944db8404b312ed8e",
      "text": "“喵喵～！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000088:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd59255fa7add69c94d4e0532438950542ae78b40eb25bd154224353befd8d77",
      "text": "“应。贯穿吧，冰点号！！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_h:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2c00cda4054752319d8663a457dbf51f61f9596ec0769fde64161750b12876ff",
      "text": "“跟得上我们兄弟俩吗！？”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000018:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d7925c854232949411555f5be27fa7bfb8331273bef02a50185277ac865ae80d",
      "text": "比赛后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5cf505d60f066a8d544ca9e771fbe2df63af2e0ce5e6de09ad1ee3f3cecff9c0",
      "text": "“你小子，\n那是哪门子乱来的过弯切入法啊……”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb9ec60600f518b3c01ded0a1b6d60e8706cf5bdbfdf0a112c9bb88d676ee477",
      "text": "“开出那种速度根本追不上啊。\n我们完败啦！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b972a87bdf2135a665b1e4cc39f7e4ddb501799382958247f36d4125de522bbf",
      "text": "“你们俩跑得也挺漂亮的嘛！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7168cd0485ca4b786a8aa30fdd763a838a7b2138abb15c4f85cab416eec5f771",
      "text": "“谢了。不过，仅仅赢了我们\n最好还是别太满足”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1d55b0617757cda261584471109c51b256659e359d94375d3a5d9394c2a68b9",
      "text": "“在这座街上，跟我们一样……不，\n比我们更强的豪杰可到处都是啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d830826d0eb7d24e91759fd11864375e5d1c6ca4a5b302429cfc768fe8384224",
      "text": "“嘿，那可非得全去打趴下不可了”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc84b66d15d96243f9e51b37cc24a98b8e1b206ad182d70959ca38d25871aa98",
      "text": "“哈哈，不愧是打倒了我们兄弟的男人！\n干劲果然不一样啊”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b58783f7136ed77270372479a4a4ee6b6a1c2a2c521c726cee38aa560c2e8ca",
      "text": "“你能否站上这街头的顶点，\n我很期待”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:160a9d8d85effbfdb3c46782735dc3a8cafaddbcabfb831cad943f928a247132",
      "text": "“噢，包在我身上！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:392d668732b7fe89d6993f8461cad37de017d6b1a78ae3eb8ded5142ecc27002",
      "text": "“听好了，绝对不准输啊！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000015:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79c62dc1ae38d3909e193a2ff6f302a2c77692892f87af8a8791891bfe4a95ed",
      "text": "拍摄结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:caef41ba31bc5ff058c07de45494fcee5247e1b04c4968ef4624d8c7ce911746",
      "text": "拍摄辛苦了！\n两位热血的演技太精彩了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8865db42d148ff55e52b79f591f4821e32fdaad1c0d47576864baa116670cf45",
      "text": "我们也是动真格互相对碰的。\n得到了一次不错的经验。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fde964bb9eb28f6bdfa88cc14cabd8ef1dac1a37e027950341237bb05c4ac41",
      "text": "嘿嘿，一条过真是太好啦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d306e451e6ffb06222a54988771033e61011e949326c33ec1f86d6a95a77b12",
      "text": "不过话说回来……摩托车的数量真惊人啊。\n这里的摩托全都要用在拍摄里吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c69a393a6b7792890814ecd4dda46932a405b4da94b5b84545456b4d0a1d1bf0",
      "text": "这辆也是……这边的也全都是，\n简直酷毙了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ff07039b679c5e74e999066b3f338a03bb14dc5297dc1a877e97e3c58534d3d3",
      "text": "哟，辛苦了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56be8a07c2934c83fb119ea4b533c75996d492892ab264964effaaad0f71fd89",
      "text": "辛苦了！朱雀先生、玄武先生。这位是\n前几天跟你们提过的总编和摩托车制造商的负责人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:253d3481c6b90d6a2dd7795986d1358eab0e66c60c251e5650d385724f959342",
      "text": "看来我们果然没看错人啊。\n拍出了下定决心的好画面！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7284bc12fb2e092f2e748ef00fbda5b9f762af755c1ffda784c5c8da2ae8f69f",
      "text": "等你们成为独当一面的男子汉时，\n再跟我们一起干一场热血的工作吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:23e709ec429af69dca28ad0796b9a15a983c5eb4f7bbb55bd1bd0e553f42a9f8",
      "text": "噢！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000105:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000118:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5f656f5f32c30a779775f3dc7acaef5ef8cdd727475e5fb1dbd2e977fec14496",
      "text": "……喂喂，我是黑野。\n辛苦了，●●●●●●●●●●番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000120:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:844f7683f261765cb8c61dcf8ee044381a17d62f2d527509584eb640346b237a",
      "text": "朱雀这家伙，明明都过了好一阵子，\n还在聊拍摄时的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000122:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:865c3a00aadb0220ef8ba913961fc77068bb9a0da6198e9d2320556de2044fe2",
      "text": "今天的练习之后也是一直在讲。\n看来是高兴得不得了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000124:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e7146a4b52f2c00c93bff7701e67b10f0d3a352c1c87ad342db9001b735a4e8f",
      "text": "我也挺开心的。\n而且也是个很好的历练。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000126:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de0362c61ef8d56acd8277827427eaf5b1b766f810115b94c4a91916b4a58cfc",
      "text": "不只是演员。导演和工作人员们，\n每一个都干劲非凡。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000128:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3b351a2e0296d018e1a29e9d5ab94a899b1334f6c1f2843a7d2bcadf30305f36",
      "text": "恐悦至极。能被邀请去那种现场，\n我深感自豪。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000130:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:631ea9e6065ea74caee2b9bbec95ccffd36ce828eb415954924f74d1547e52d6",
      "text": "是因为两位的热忱\n传达过去了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000131:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a353ee3cfb63c4bcadc663f6a725e3fd15ffb596b9a63812c1dc9ba4de2eaa39",
      "text": "今后也继续把这份\n缘分维系下去吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000134:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:156033ce81eefd1228947f48251d7009cf07034cd4c02ddabc61426a170201a0",
      "text": "是啊，也谢谢你，\n●●●●●●●●●●番长。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000136:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f49d9b2bb00e9c3af097f34f22e5f46d10c8d234ccf66eead5564a0bc560a21",
      "text": "发愤兴起，为了能再次收到邀请，\n我今后也会继续努力的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_j:cmd-000138:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c3745266923d6c0a40f94510ab41e1399eab55dfd7f7b309acbf930b3410dea1",
      "text": "那么，再会了。\n从明天开始的练习也拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f2364eefcd36a0b58edb1d7109b376b0093176eb2d1534b982a76d40c033019",
      "text": "朱雀的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000014:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6cac41071f8f265a5194eb81b9bb8538009c45d4b727a8c30018e31d9412a2d5",
      "text": "喵，喵啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ca3d9b2e95b4a08eed5b134b806cfc0951786b12857b85b706901ae5a10ba0b9",
      "text": "噢，喵子也对杂志感兴趣吗？\n一起看吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ac2cb8d7481610333ba74d5ff49f803bdea16e211c6178013541e8a41e03bfc0",
      "text": "这个月的特辑是……嗯？\n这、这不全是我们报道嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b9ea5f9c16c39e5a34be5bd2fed3cff7d47b93b078c08f1b38a382dc2ad5be99",
      "text": "写的什么……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1010df58129afd3d3aed9135690cdb19145b40e83749862d9eded54b31d3419f",
      "text": "“神速一魂的歌声中倾注了灵魂。\n非常符合本杂志风格的激情歌曲”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:71cb90bdf9f96f8070e355336ffb6c85d0a2af7d83eed645cb6601b61cb6abf4",
      "text": "“由衷庆幸能拜托这群热血汉子。\n令人期待他们的未来”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88bc74a1b1cfa35846bbf60e32ea1b07c15df2a89312eeda4dd7320a6fce2f80",
      "text": "然后这边是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2ea2fb58d823f8a5d0e9ece73d225cd28a8997f7ad8b2651bf48cd8b9813a010",
      "text": "“神速一魂展现出了不似配角的强烈存在感，\n敬请前往影院一睹雄姿！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9fff003ac472e5f3f008e238611face211b96d5eb075f7ff80301b1e5a8e808e",
      "text": "呜喔喔喔，太棒了！\n成功啦，喵子！！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:360ba9083c5956cea80a92783b8bc7c49b4b06080d9ee4b822bed4c2b6131917",
      "text": "喵——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_3_10010_01:1_3_10010_01_k:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48acec0e07759db56b70bd3c059b2e29adca9282a9bddb01e70aa59e3020902b",
      "text": "可不能在这干坐着了，赶紧骑自行车去兜一圈吧！\n跟上来，喵子！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
